# The drafting-library source zip -- 119 MB one-time asset for
# scripts/import-drafting-library.mjs. Extracted contents are what the
# script uploads to Supabase; the zip itself should never enter git
# history, where it can't be removed after the fact.
Legal_Drafting_Template_Library*.zip

# AI-generated image assets belong in Supabase Storage (uploaded via
# update_images.mjs), not the repo -- 19 MB and growing per generation
# would bloat every future clone.
public/images/ai/
update_images.mjs